{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You just got hired to guard the button that destroys the Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So you better take your task seriously. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seriously, that is your job now. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just whatever you do, you are not supposed to press the button, otherwise the world goes poof. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have no idea how many things can distract you while doing this task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh and did I mention there are literally no breaks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So if you decide to quit, that also destroys the Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just guard the button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For the Sake of The world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 different events to react to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seeing the timer go up</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with other guards through an Online Leaderboard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game will test your patience, how long can you guard the button?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539870?t=1740656056","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539870?t=1740656056","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539870/0c658b7b2750e1741e5cee51ee519e85b5ba8243/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740656056","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539870/0c658b7b2750e1741e5cee51ee519e85b5ba8243/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740656056","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"